      "expansion_note": "Complete list/table/turn/Q&A context may exceed requested count; original blocks unchanged.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_id": "block-000068-cb9cb3f3",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[80]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 68,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Over the last decade, our research teams have pushed the boundaries of AI forward, which is displayed through Gemini 3, our most intelligent AI model yet. Designed to deliver advanced multimodal understanding, Gemini 3 represents our most capable iteration of agentic and generative coding technologies. Gemini 3 integrates enhanced reasoning capabilities to support visualizations and interactive user experiences across our product ecosystem, including Search and the Gemini app.",
          "text_hash": "cb9cb3f3a70d2f53a18b0e615d3e298fcd5d8df9a0b6c117d74a64dd322108a0",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000069-05305a43",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[81]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 69,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "As technology continues to improve rapidly, we are focused on bringing our latest AI advances to our products and platforms. We continue to help our users access information and knowledge, express themselves, and get things done by embedding the power of generative AI and Gemini into our products and platforms. Today, all 15 of our half-billion-user products — including seven with two billion users — use our Gemini models. For our Google Cloud customers, our offerings are helping organizations stay at the forefront of innovation with solutions such as Gemini Enterprise and Gemini for Google Workspace.",
          "text_hash": "05305a43aabf512c56de8da598c68144782d7c37222de012a763b08783081c25",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000070-bfd47c66",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[82]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 70,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Guided by our AI principles, we believe our approach to AI must be both bold and responsible. That means developing AI in a way that maximizes the positive benefits to society while addressing its potential challenges.",
          "text_hash": "bfd47c66180bf25e9bb8d8ef0a17fd1e0a670398963dc26d961e9430cd9e4a78",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000071-7664792a",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[83]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 71,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-style": "italic",
            "font-weight": "700",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Moonshots",
          "text_hash": "7664792a52f0fe195b5d988eb5975e051f3ac4c9b012c1496a07f79775824715",
          "type": "heading_candidate"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000072-6fc7e995",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[84]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 72,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Many companies get comfortable doing what they have always done, making only incremental changes. This incrementalism leads to irrelevance over time, especially in technology, where change tends to be revolutionary, not evolutionary.",
          "text_hash": "6fc7e995955364b7745c7927f4bfbe7b27ecb1c74f11e27af38517b08b078c50",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000073-1028dedb",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[85]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 73,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Our early investments in AI started out as moonshots but are now incorporated into our core products and central to future developments. In Other Bets, our fully autonomous driving technology company, Waymo, is now providing fully autonomous, paid ride-hailing services to customers in multiple cities. Isomorphic Labs is reimagining the drug discovery process from first principles, applying AI to accelerate the development of new medicines. We continue to look toward the future and to invest for the long term, most notably for the application of AI to our products and services, as well as other frontier technologies such as quantum computing.",
          "text_hash": "1028dedb6e572f5bc124f1529dac648d94f2e2f6ae7017de40b1c5771ca04c15",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000074-c05a319b",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[86]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 74,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-style": "italic",
            "font-weight": "700",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Privacy and Security",
          "text_hash": "c05a319b68060d02b74f81c2c337b6c5fe68cc8f9567327328d42770ccdb82cd",
          "type": "heading_candidate"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000075-f0af3678",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[87]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 75,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "We make it a priority to protect the privacy and security of our products, users, and customers, even if there are near-term financial consequences. We do this by continuously investing in building products that are secure by default; strictly upholding responsible data practices that emphasize privacy by design; and building easy-to-use settings that put people in control. We are continually enhancing these efforts over time, whether by enabling users to auto-delete their data, applying privacy technologies like on-device processing, giving people tools to control their experience, or advancing anti-malware, anti-phishing, and password security features.",
          "text_hash": "f0af36788acad032126553327b96c4a7381292f6b82fe4993401921345d6068f",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000076-ce770667",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[88]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 76,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "700",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Google",
          "text_hash": "ce770667e5f9b0d8f55367bb79419689d90c48451bb33f079f3a9a72ae132de8",
          "type": "heading_candidate"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000077-0ba57163",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[89]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 77,
          "reported_page": 4,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "For reporting purposes Google comprises two segments: Google Services and Google Cloud.",
          "text_hash": "0ba5716385dd22017e3a74cf0a4793271157ccacf741e8218c3b527bdb20cb72",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
